    {
      "id": "UeV-jKWXDMNcCn2uV9x_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 414,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 698.2196044921875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 412041699,
      "version": 264,
      "versionNonce": 863567021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789583550160,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Unit Tests\n    - Write these to \"prove\" a complex algorithm\n     - e.g. VIN parsing. \n    - use unit tests to figure stuff out. \"Design\" - TDD\n        - Jeff Note: about 80-90% of these tests don't get checked in.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Unit Tests\n    - Write these to \"prove\" a complex algorithm\n     - e.g. VIN parsing. \n    - use unit tests to figure stuff out. \"Design\" - TDD\n        - Jeff Note: about 80-90% of these tests don't get checked in.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
